Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的城市来了位明星。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的名字叫异次元超能力者罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 扮演罗宾的风也
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不是那样的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙因为妈妈的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}试图去扮演罗宾{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果变成了真正的罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也 我一定要解开你身上的诅咒。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 风也 银河女王。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你只要一直守护着罗宾的形象{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}活下去就好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有人能救我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也 这 No.们简直
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是你内心的写照啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？ 怎么了 游马这么晚了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 十万火急 和铁男一起把风也的妈妈{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带到这里来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.69,0:00:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 我正在和风也 不 和罗宾决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:01:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗无论如何都想让她看一看。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.47,0:01:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。 嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.65,0:01:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也 我一定会把你变回原样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要一飞冲天啊 我。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.31,0:02:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星之罗宾到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合为止都有贯通效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要撑过罗宾的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只能用希望皇霍普的效果了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事我知道啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 就算想召唤霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的手牌里也没有等级4的怪兽只有1只。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的抽卡决定一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了～。好嘞，上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤嘎嘎嘎魔术师。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着，我特殊召唤影蜥蜴。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影蜥蜴虽然不能通常召唤，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但在召唤等级4的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.43,0:03:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的嘎嘎嘎魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}影蜥蜴叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。现身吧，No.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.49,0:03:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.97,0:03:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍～普。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:04:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，这里应该尽可能多地干掉敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 银河女王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为死域魔王的咒印效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法被破坏。 啊？ 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的你太老实了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！我是为了风也才进行决斗的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哪有闲工夫跟你吵架。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也同感。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你才是 居然会执着于某个人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行决斗 还真是少见啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他是孤独的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.51,0:04:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没人能拯救我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我总觉得能明白那种心情。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来这场决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你的目的似乎是一样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算目的一样 我还是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦。上吧，希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击野兽战士美洲狮。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:05:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了。发动陷阱。团结之翼。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的。陷阱卡 团结之翼是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上有明星知更鸟在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对手发起战斗时将那次攻击无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，特殊召唤凤皇兽盖鲁达。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.97,0:05:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊——！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤等级6的怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.77,0:05:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太慢了，盖鲁达。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.60,0:05:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来总算是赶上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是在跟电视上一样演戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到竟然能亲眼见到。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，你应该已经前往公主那里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！你们真正的伙伴怎么能丢下不管啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖鲁达 皮尤曼。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还真是炽热的羁绊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不太明白但内心深处热了起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:06:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！现在可不是感动的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的攻击被挡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的场地上有4只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再通过凤皇兽盖鲁达的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.44,0:06:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！现在能做的只有……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里要守住。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.57,0:06:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赌在手牌里右边的那张卡上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不太懂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵……我进一步召唤另一名同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么 又来！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上集齐异次元超能者 星之罗宾{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}野兽战士 美洲狮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凤凰兽 盖鲁达时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.33,0:06:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的同伴大放送！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.73,0:06:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧铁巨人 铁锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.09,0:06:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:07:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗 铁锤。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁巨人 铁锤。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}脑袋缺根螺丝差点被丢弃的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被罗宾救下的白铁战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然俺来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就别想碰罗宾一根手指头！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力3500！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这玩意儿能打倒吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把人带来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是风也君的妈妈哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是怎……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！？那是……风也？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.35,0:07:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也……真的是风也吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在做什么啊？风也！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是你母亲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是？说什么奇怪的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的妈妈在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不是什么风也。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是异次元超能力者 罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也的妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事件的真正犯人是风也……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，是罗宾！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会，胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙为了回应妈妈的期待{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直拼命努力着。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.30,0:08:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为此，他从哈欠的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.14,0:08:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再也回不来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈欠？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说，是虚构的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……风也！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾，你只要不断地为我带来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗之荣光就好了哦，哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个就是我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也，听我的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴，好好看着这场决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看着风也心中母亲的模样。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗重新开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用一个叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.69,0:09:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次发动银河女王的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到下个回合，让自己场上所有怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为不死之身，并赋予贯通效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.89,0:09:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，星光 Robin 和他的同伴们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:15.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次承受我的魔力吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那些碍事的家伙统统干掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。发动盖尔达的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖尔达在攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升300点。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，攻击希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用一个叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动希望皇霍普的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效盖尔达的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我的攻击还没结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧，战斗的大放送！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星辉罗宾 攻击希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.45,0:09:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惊奇拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 再次 发动霍普的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效那次攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:10:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这样一来霍普的超量素材就变成零了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是太大手大脚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我发动铁巨人 铁锤的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁锤在场上的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己等级4以下的怪兽1只
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 美洲狮！ 直接攻击！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！ 唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.28,0:10:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶——！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶——！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，发动陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.40,0:10:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信我！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！陷阱卡发动！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 痛恨的控诉 在对方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击受到伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:11:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得对方场上守备力最高的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽的控制权{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到自己的下一个回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚——！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁锤，你要背叛我们吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是那样！不过{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒这么弱的家伙我实在提不起劲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.67,0:11:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法。我盖放1张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 为什么要用铁锤……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到了下一个人的回合 这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会回到罗宾身边了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就好。 不 应该说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要打倒他们 只能这么做了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真搞不懂啊。 说起来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 看过那个节目吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.88,0:11:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后会怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个故事的结局是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你把电视关了我没看到。哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪我咯！ 唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:12:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯独这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不能放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也…… 我一定要把你……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续魔法 攻通规制！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对手场上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有3只以上怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手无法进行攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.31,0:12:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《总之这样就能争取到时间了！》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来胜利的豌豆就凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.23,0:12:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！？　要赢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.43,0:12:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河女王被死之马克的咒印
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河女王的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的怪兽全部都会变成不死之身。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我看到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当罗宾家族齐聚之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾将铁锤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变形为异次元喷气铁号{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用必杀铁凤凰将敌人粉碎。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:12:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个 罗宾宅！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 把手牌的两张卡盖伏。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.73,0:13:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 盖这张卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～ 你的指手画脚虽然让人火大{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 把两张卡盖伏 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无谓的 挣扎……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后在这里你的陷阱卡效果结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁锤会回到我的场地上。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你刚才在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星之罗宾 不要原谅那些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道 妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别这样了！ 求你了 风也！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.32,0:13:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！ 我是罗宾！ 我必须
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直是 罗宾才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于攻通规制 我的攻击你以为封住了吗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:14:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变换！喷气铁号！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在罗宾家族
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}齐聚场地的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将它们解放
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤异次元喷气铁号。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧，喷气铁号！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元喷气铁号的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为变换！喷气铁号时解放的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击力总和。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，攻击力是8000！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力8000这怎么可能打得赢啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别慌。是陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.46,0:14:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？陷阱卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……啊～到底发动哪张啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！这种时候就这是决斗饭！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，游马你呀。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！脑子开始转起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:15:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动的卡是陷阱卡 燃烧的斗志！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.89,0:15:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力翻倍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 铁人号的攻击力是８０００！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没意义啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽已经
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}合体成１只了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你使用的攻击通行规制{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果没有３只以上的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果不会发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.87,0:15:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要发动的是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 埋伏旋风！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}埋伏旋风是 让1只怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}控制权转移给对方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡被解放的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方的一张魔法或陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 我要破坏的是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}死灵麦克斯的咒印！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.49,0:16:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？ 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 保护银河女王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.48,0:16:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的卡就没有了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我的攻击是停不下来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必杀技的大放送！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击希望皇霍普 铁号！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 铁凤凰！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！ 果然还是不行啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 这样就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.70,0:16:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的场上还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一张陷阱卡残留着。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 胜利的豌豆就凑齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 你 还记得那时候的事……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.47,0:16:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元杀法 向量转换！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.78,0:16:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 当对方怪兽攻击过来的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那只怪兽变成守备表示……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方表侧守备怪兽1只变成攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.93,0:17:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！ 这样一来 就无法攻击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.03,0:17:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 不 还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖1张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.11,0:17:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.63,0:17:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 这样一来只要攻击银河女王的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能打倒罗宾呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你做好觉悟了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张盖牌如果是反弹攻击的计数器的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.93,0:17:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是啊，这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能赢的机会，只有这里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让风也恢复原状的机会也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:18:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普，攻击银河女王！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星·罗宾永存！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？是计数器吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对方攻击过来的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地的星·罗宾以攻击力零复活{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被攻击的怪兽的替身！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.65,0:18:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了！游马赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.73,0:18:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是计数器啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算以攻击力零 把
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星·知更鸟回到场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负也不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要做那种没用的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是没用。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也是想保护啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.73,0:19:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护自己的妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.29,0:19:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜呜…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这段记忆是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.51,0:19:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}风也……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈 我 到底……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经……已经够了 风也。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.47,0:19:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然 一个人憋了这么久 我……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我错了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.85,0:20:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.05,0:20:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿！ 还真有点羡慕啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.46,0:20:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿 这样一来 那家伙说不定{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于能变回真正的自己了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过游马 你为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不早点把罗宾的事告诉我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 你知道了会失望的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.93,0:20:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是知道罗宾才是真凶的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～ 你还挺会替人着想的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才、才没有在顾虑你什么的好吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨～蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘛！说人家笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 一点都不懂体贴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么外卖啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.57,0:20:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂喂……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 你是个罗宾控
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才是问题所在吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.21,0:21:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！我的力量竟然……！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.43,0:21:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜…… 啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}罗宾……罗宾。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}妈妈～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜～！这不是挺感人的嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.69,0:21:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察结果 其之10。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人类的亲子之爱我无法理解…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不理解也无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我　那段记忆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是我诞生时的记忆…》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.91,0:22:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的名字是　星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.78,0:22:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这个世界的未来托付给你赋予你…　使命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.23,0:22:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗　开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.91,0:22:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通常召唤怪兽的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.51,0:22:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击表示是　表侧。　那么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.45,0:23:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么小鸟被绑架了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.28,0:23:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，我要是决斗赢了就还回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.48,0:23:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道是　No.卡干的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.14,0:23:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}管它是 No.卡还是什么　都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟　我一定救你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.60,0:24:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下集　游戏王ZEXAL
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惊猫吓猫猫卡组！？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.87,0:24:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.34,0:24:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背面朝上。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻到背面，横向放置。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.78,0:24:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很容易搞错，要小心点哦！

何だって
小鳥が誘拐された！？
しかも、おれがデュエルに勝てたらかえすだと？
もしや　ナンバーズの仕業？
ナンバーズだろうか何だろうか関係ね
小鳥　俺絶対助けてやるからな

次回　遊戯王ゼアル
キャットオドロく猫デッキ！？

かっとビングだ、オレ！！

